pipeline.library/AddFDList                         pipeline.library/AddFDList

    NAME
        AddFDList -- Add a list of ARexx functions and/or control codes
                     to the Pipeline system.

    SYNOPSIS
        fdlist = AddFDList( fdfuncs, Xpander, MinCC, MaxCC )
          D0                  A0       A1       d0     d1

        APTR AddFDList( struct fdfunc *, int (*)(), int, int );

    FUNCTION
        Allows you to add more ARexx functions and/or control codes to
        Pipeline.  See the docs 'RexxFuncs.doc' for more information on
        this function.

    INPUTS
        fdfunc  - Pointer to an array of fdfuncs.
        Xpander - Your control code expander function.
        MinCC   - Minimum control code you support.
        MaxCC   - Maximum control code you support.

    RESULTS
        0 - couldn't install commands/codes
       >0 - success (a fdlist pointer - PRIVATE!!!)

    SEE ALSO
        RemFDList()
pipeline.library/AddGad                               pipeline.library/AddGad

    NAME
        AddGad -- Add a gadget to the control screen.

    SYNOPSIS
