pipeline.library/DontKillMe                       pipeline.library/DontKillMe

    NAME
        DontKillMe -- Tell Pipeline not to send your task any signals when
                      it is closing down.  Cancels a call to KillMe.

    SYNOPSIS
        success = DontKillMe( void )
          d0
          
        int DontKillMe( void );

    FUNCTION
        If you previously called KillMe but need to exit before Pipeline
        then a call to this function will tell Pipeline not to send you any
        signals when it closes.
        
    INPUTS
       NONE

    RESULTS
       FALSE - Not sucessful.
       TRUE  - Task removed from list.

    BUGS

    SEE ALSO
       DontKillMe(), LineKillMe(), LineDontKillMe()

