pipeline.library/Time                                   pipeline.library/Time

    NAME
        Time -- Returns the system time.

    SYNOPSIS
        time = Time( &time )
         d0            a0

        ULONG = Time( ULONG * );

    FUNCTION
        A re-entrant version of the standard C function for use in Rexx
        functions.  It returns the number of seconds since 1978.

    INPUTS
        If a ULONG pointer is given, the time will also be stored there.
        NULL may be specified.
        
    RESULTS
        time - Current number of seconds since 01-Jan-1978

    SEE ALSO
        GMTime()

