pipeline.library/UnLoadUser                       pipeline.library/UnLoadUser

    NAME
        UnLoadUser -- Free user structure.

    SYNOPSIS
        error = UnLoadUser( User )
         D0                  A0

        ULONG UnLoadUser( struct User * );

    FUNCTION
        Frees the user structure that was got with LoadUser().  If the user
        structure is no longer needed, the memory is freed.

    INPUTS
        User - Pointer to a user structure.

    RESULTS
         0 - Pipeline is not loaded.
        -1 - Couldn't lock the user list
         1 - Freed the user data.

    BUGS
        None.

    SEE ALSO
        LoadUser(), SaveUser(), MakeNewUser(), DeleteUser()
