pipeline.library/WriteUserLog                   pipeline.library/WriteUserLog 

    NAME
        WriteUserLog -- Write a message to a specific user.

    SYNOPSIS
        success = WriteUserLog( Name, Text )
          d0                     a1    a0

        BOOL WriteUserLog( char *, char * );

    FUNCTION
        If the user is currently online, this function will call
        SendLineMsg.  If the user is not online, the message will be
        written to the users event log.

    INPUTS
        Name - The name (or alias) of the user to send the message to.
        Text - The message text.  Length is limited only by memory.
        
    RESULTS
        TRUE  - Message has been saved.
        FALSE - An error occured and the message was not sent.

    SEE ALSO
        SendLineMsg()

